# The image copies only app/, scripts/, requirements*.txt and the dist built
# in stage 1 — everything else stays out of the build context (and out of the
# image): dev/tests/e2e artifacts are bind-mounted or run from the host, and
# frontend/{node_modules,dist} are rebuilt inside the frontend stage.
